### Node ###
# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
# Test fixtures cut from real evidence keep their real names, and one of them is a *.log: the P4-3 commit lost all
# seventeen stdin-writes.log fixtures to the rule above at `git add` time and CI failed on a clean checkout while every
# local run passed (2026-09-04, run 33915532579). scripts/ci/fixtures_test.go fails `make test` on any ignored fixture.
!scripts/ci/testdata/**/*.log

# Diagnostic reports (https://nodejs.org/api/report.html)
report.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json

